                                                "sense_id": "c363f3fa-a9dc-36ec-aad9-86a1d9604f62",
                                                "text": "For the umpteenth time, I chickened."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "35645870-5c03-4a2a-9752-8b572af554ea",
                                                "sense_id": "c363f3fa-a9dc-36ec-aad9-86a1d9604f62",
                                                "text": "ABE: What are you chucking it for, then? You're running, aren't you? Running, cos you chickened.\n SLIM: All right, so I chickened."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "81fa1610-4cf8-4cbf-a995-2bce3c9f00c9",
                                                "sense_id": "c363f3fa-a9dc-36ec-aad9-86a1d9604f62",
                                                "text": "To reach the lower branches of the blackwood one had to swing Tarzan-like across a narrow gully choked with gorse and blackberries. […] [T]he challenge of the rope swing was definitely more in James' line. […] Even if he slipped and failed, or worse, chickened, they would be unlikely to judge too harshly."
                                            }
